# Ellines Haven — environment reference
#
# HOSTING: Cloudflare Pages (haven.ellines.co.ke). There is no Vercel config.
# DATABASE / AUTH / FUNCTIONS: Firebase project `ellines-haven-web`.
#
# ── Cloudflare Pages (dashboard → Settings → Environment variables) ──────────
# Used at build time by Vite (must be prefixed with VITE_):
#   VITE_PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY   Live/test Paystack public key
#   VITE_ENV_MODE              production | development
#
# Local: copy into `.env.local` (gitignored via `*.local`).
#
# ── Firebase Functions (server-side only — never ship in the browser) ────────
# Secrets (firebase functions:secrets:set NAME):
#   RESEND_API_KEY             Resend API key (shared Ellines Resend account OK)
#   SMTP_* / AT_*              Optional SMTP + Africa's Talking fallbacks
#   MPESA_* / PAYSTACK_SECRET / PAYPAL_*   Payments
#
# String params (defaults baked in code; override via functions/.env or deploy):
#   RESEND_FROM                Ellines Haven <noreply@haven.ellines.co.ke>
#   LEADS_NOTIFY_EMAIL         tech@ellines.co.ke
#   ORDERS_NOTIFY_EMAIL        tech@ellines.co.ke
#   CAREERS_NOTIFY_EMAIL       info@ellines.co.ke
#
# Mirror of Ellines Tech Website (.dev.vars / Pages env):
#   LEADS_NOTIFY_EMAIL / ORDERS_NOTIFY_EMAIL → tech@ellines.co.ke
#   CAREERS_NOTIFY_EMAIL → info@ellines.co.ke
#   RESEND_FROM Tech uses: Ellines Tech <noreply@ellines.co.ke>
#   RESEND_FROM Haven uses: Ellines Haven <noreply@haven.ellines.co.ke>
#
# Public customer-facing addresses (site UI — not notify destinations):
#   haven@ellines.co.ke   Orders / leads display
#   info@ellines.co.ke    General / careers display
